+/// A document embedded in a rectangle: the page that embeds the board draws the document's content inside the box, and the label
+/// keeps its title (what any other reader shows). `item` names the document for that page; the engine never interprets it.
+#[derive(Clone, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, Serialize, Deserialize)]
+pub struct Embed {
